                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Feskagazar injects themselves with breath recharger, which activates their breath gland. They immediately recover their boreal breath, but they take @Damage[2d8[untyped]] damage as a side effect.</p>"
