            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Feskagazar's specially grafted throat glands produce corrosive nanites. They exhale, dealing @Damage[4d4[acid]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] (@Check[reflex|dc:21|basic] save). After using Breathe Nanites, they can't use it again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge it]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
                },
