                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The injection rifle's cartridges contain harmful substances that deal damage and impose a secondary effect on a failed @Check[fortitude|dc:21] save. A specialized revolver allows Feskagazar to choose which ammo to use as a free action.</p><ul><li><p><em>Axon Peeler:</em> @Damage[(1d8+5)[mental]] damage, plus @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} on failure</p></li><li><p><em>Blood Boiler:</em> @Damage[(1d8+5)[fire]] damage, plus @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} on failure</p></li><li><p><em>Cryo Sting:</em> @Damage[(1d8+5)[cold]] damage, plus @Damage[1d6[persistent,bludgeoning]] damage on failure</p>\n</li></ul>"
